Package: libxcomposite1
Version: @DEB_LIBXCOMPOSITE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libx11-6, libxfixes3
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Description: X11 Composite extension library
 libXcomposite provides an X Window System client interface to the Composite
 extension to the X protocol.
 .
 The Composite extension causes a entire sub-tree of the window hierarchy to be
 rendered to an off-screen buffer. Applications can then take the contents of
 that buffer and do whatever they like with it.
 .
 More information about X.Org can be found at: <URL:https://www.X.org>
